  "translation": "A bɔlen na, a fwɛlɛw nana, u y'u ye — yala, so sanfɛ da datugulen don. U ko: “Iyɔrɔ de, a bɛ ⟨את⟩ a senw datugu so yerayɛrɛ kɔnɔ.”",
